Storyteller is a book/story formatting library/template. Not only does it help
with formatting: it also provides tools to help authors make sure they come back
to aspects of their stories, format the resulting document to make hand-editing
easier, and constructs to help authors mark various parts of their stories that
need revisiting.

Navigating this project:
- The source code for the library is in the 'src/' directory.
- The 'version' file simply contains the text of the current version number of
  Storyteller. It is really only for scripting, such as when building the
  package to be submitted to Typst.
